  "text": "**cc-track Enhancement Opportunities from spec-kit**\n\nPriority implementations:\n1. Structured clarification system - scan for ambiguities, ask targeted questions, integrate answers\n2. Constitutional gates - enforce architectural principles with mandatory checkpoints\n3. Severity-based validation - CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW instead of binary pass/fail\n4. Cross-artifact consistency analysis - detect conflicts between task/code/docs\n\nThe key insight: cc-track excels at implementation (context preservation, validation, git workflow) while spec-kit excels at specification (clarification, structure, methodology). A synthesis would be powerful.\n\nQuick wins: Add [NEEDS CLARIFICATION] markers, implement severity levels in validation, detect task types for TDD ordering.",
